%% Sequence: POST /api/search (Web/CLI client) with Ollama query expansion and fallback
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Client (CLI `search` / curl)
    participant L as Drogon event loop
    participant SC as SearchController
    participant RP as requestPool (ThreadPool)
    participant SS as SearchService
    participant QE as QueryExpander
    participant OC as OllamaClient
    participant O as Ollama (qwen2.5:3b)
    participant SE as SearchEngine
    participant II as InvertedIndex

    C->>L: POST /api/search {"query":"car","mode":"keyword","limit":10}
    L->>SC: handle(request)
    SC->>SC: parseRequest(): query, mode, limit, expand
    alt validation error
        SC-->>C: 400 {"error":"invalid_query" | "invalid_mode" | ...}
    else index not built
        SC-->>C: 503 {"error":"index_not_ready"}
    end
    SC->>RP: post(pipeline task)
    Note over L: event loop is free for other clients
    RP->>SS: runPipeline(query, limit, expand)
    SS->>QE: expand(query)
    QE->>OC: isAvailable() (cached 5 s)
    alt Ollama available
        QE->>OC: generate(JSON prompt)
        OC->>O: POST /api/generate {"format":"json","stream":false}
        O-->>OC: {"response": "{expanded_terms: [...]}"}
        OC-->>QE: response text
        QE->>QE: parseResponse(): JSON, sanitize, dedupe, ≤ 6 terms
        QE-->>SS: status = ok, expanded_terms
    else unavailable / timeout (30 s) / invalid JSON
        QE-->>SS: status = fallback, fallback_reason
        Note over SS: logged as WARN, search continues
    end
    SS->>SE: search(buildQueryTerms(query, expanded, w = 0.5), limit)
    SE->>II: visitDocumentLengths() + visitPostings(term) [shared locks]
    SE->>SE: TF-IDF accumulation, partial_sort top-K
    SE->>II: snippet(docId, terms) (reads file)
    SE-->>SS: SearchResponse
    SS-->>RP: PipelineResult
    RP-->>C: 200 {"results":[...],"time_ms":..,"expansion_status":"ok",...}
